reagent-name-calordine = calordine
reagent-desc-calordine = A potent stimulant that rapidly raises body temperature, causing an increased appetite and thirst.

reagent-name-cryodine = cryodine
reagent-desc-cryodine = A drug that exploits the unnatural properties of the local sea water to rapidly lower body temperature.

reagent-name-somnuzine = somnuzine
reagent-desc-somnuzine = A sedative developed for use during flooding in Sweetwater. Induces sleep and rapidly lowers body temperature, treating cold and asphyxiation damage at sufficiently low temperatures.

reagent-name-anti-caustic = anti-caustic solution
reagent-desc-anti-caustic = A specialised treatment for caustic burns, both acidic and basic.

reagent-name-leparadine = leparadine
reagent-desc-leparadine = A temperature-regulating medicine intended for elevated body temperatures, while also treating heat and electrical burns.

reagent-name-lexodine = lexodine
reagent-desc-lexodine = A combined medicine derived from lepo and lepa that stabilises body temperature at both extremes, while treating frostbite, heat burns, and electrical burns. Its effectiveness against specific injuries varies with body temperature.

reagent-name-saltwater-solution-brute = rotten eggs
reagent-desc-saltwater-solution-brute = A crude alcoholic preparation of ethanol, sea water, and sulfur with a strange ability to treat brute trauma.

reagent-name-saltwater-solution-burn = battery acid
reagent-desc-saltwater-solution-burn = A crude alcoholic preparation of ethanol, sea water, and lithium with a strange ability to treat thermal and electrical injuries.
